    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 20, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "当我们走向地下深处的过道时，<br>\n一排排厚重的门扉映入眼帘。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 23, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.8999999761581421, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 24, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.2"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 25, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "21_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [-5.0, 0.0], "Zoom": 0.5, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 27, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000", "Duration": 1.2000000476837158, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "Transparent", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.8"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "透过小窗，<br>\n我们往里面看去。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……看来这里是惩罚室的区域呢。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "惩罚室？是做什么的地方？", "AuthorId": "Noah", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Noah001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "诺亚也站在我旁边往里面张望。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "哇，里面有好多危险的东西！", "AuthorId": "Noah", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Noah002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 53, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "把那个那个还有那个堆叠起来做成装置艺术，<br>\n应该会很好玩～", "AuthorId": "Noah", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Noah003"]}},
    {"op": "ResetText", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 60, "indent": 0, "params": {"Duration": 0.8999999761581421, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "SolidColor", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.2"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 62, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [0.0, 0.0], "Zoom": 0.0, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "3_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 64, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000", "Duration": 1.2000000476837158, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "Transparent", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 65, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.8"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 67, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 68, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Noah.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……是吗？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 74, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "诺亚试图打开门，<br>\n但门被一把挂锁锁住了，打不开。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 76, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 77, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Noah.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 79, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "气气——进不去啊？<br>\n这样就没法画画了。", "AuthorId": "Noah", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Noah004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 81, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "看来是这样。那我们去别的地方吧——", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro003"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 83, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 85, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我刚转身，<br>\n就看到一个少女从过道那头走了过来。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 87, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Alisa.Surprised1,Option-ArmL-Off"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 91, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "………！", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 93, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "是紫藤亚里沙。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 95, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "她也注意到了我们，<br>\n尴尬地站在原地。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 97, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 98, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [40.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed", "SubId": "Middle"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 99, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [20.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Noah.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 101, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙，你应该已经被放出来了吧。<br>\n来这里是有什么事？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 103, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 105, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "没必要告诉你。", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 107, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "是吗。那就不多问了。<br>\n诺亚，我们走。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 109, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙手里拿的那张纸，是什么？", "AuthorId": "Noah", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Noah005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 111, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我正准备带着诺亚从亚里沙身边经过，<br>\n但诺亚似乎对亚里沙手中的纸很感兴趣。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 113, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我也注意到了，顿时吃了一惊。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 115, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [40.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Surprised1", "SubId": "Middle"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 117, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（……报纸……？）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 119, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "看到这个与监牢格格不入的东西，<br>\n我不能坐视不理，向亚里沙走近一步。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative010"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 121, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed", "SubId": "Middle"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 122, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 124, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你这是在哪里得到的？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro007"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 126, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 128, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……惩罚室里。<br>\n被绑在十字刑架上的时候，<br>\n偶然在架子缝隙里发现的。", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 130, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙不情愿地回答道。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative011"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 132, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 134, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不知道是用了什么方法，<br>\n但好像是之前像我们这样被抓来的家伙搞到的。", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 136, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "在这个监牢里，<br>\n外界的信息被彻底屏蔽了。<br>\n这样看来，很可能是以前的某个囚犯用了什么魔法。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 138, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我已经看过好几遍了，给你吧。", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 140, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙把报纸递给了我。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative012"]}},
    {"op": "UpdateWitchBook", "line": 148, "indent": 0, "params": {"Id": "14", "Category": "Note", "Version": 1}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 150, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed", "SubId": "Middle"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 152, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "五年前的报道啊。真有意思……", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro009"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 154, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "是啊……我想着也许还有其他线索，<br>\n所以来找找看。", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 156, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "就算有什么，<br>\n所有惩罚室都上了锁，<br>\n不进去的话恐怕找不到吧。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro010"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 158, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 160, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啧，这样哦……", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 162, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我突然注意到，<br>\n亚里沙给我的报纸边缘有微微的烧焦痕迹。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative013"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 164, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "有被烧过的痕迹啊。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro011"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 166, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 168, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "那是我干的。<br>\n报纸上有用血写的字，看着瘆得慌。", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 170, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不过后来我想可能是重要信息，<br>\n就没继续烧了。", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa009"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 172, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 174, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我的魔法是【点火】。", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa010"]}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 177, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_30", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 179, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Alisa.Normal1,ArmL11,Angle01/Option_ArmL>Option_ArmL11"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 181, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙在手指尖上<br>\n轻轻燃起一小团火焰，<br>\n就好像拿着一支看不见的打火机似的。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative014"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 183, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [20.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Noah.Smile1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 185, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "哇～，好漂亮！！", "AuthorId": "Noah", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Noah006"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 187, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Alisa.Surprised1,Option-ArmL-Off"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 189, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "漂、漂亮个屁啊！", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa011"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 191, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "欸——超级漂亮啊？<br>\n亚里沙真厉害。", "AuthorId": "Noah", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Noah007"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 193, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Alisa.Flushed1,ArmL2,Option-ArmL-Off"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 195, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你这家伙真让人摸不着头脑……", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 197, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（能够产生火焰的魔法吗……如果魔女化程度加深，<br>\n　这种能力可能会变得很危险）", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro012"]}},
    {"op": "UpdateWitchBook", "line": 199, "indent": 0, "params": {"Id": "Alisa", "Category": "Profile", "Version": 6}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 201, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我们该走了。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Hiro013"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 203, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "随你们便。<br>\n我还想再调查一下这附近。", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Alisa013"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 205, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 207, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙似乎被惩罚室吸引住了，<br>\n她摇摇晃晃地向深处走去。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative015"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 209, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我们离开了那里。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv15_Narrative016"]}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 216, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv"}},
    {"op": "GotoModified", "line": 218, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Act02_Chapter01/Act02_Chapter01_Adv12", "SoftReset": 1}}
  ],
  "translations": {
  "0201Adv15_Narrative001": "当我们走向地下深处的过道时，<br>\n一排排厚重的门扉映入眼帘。",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative002": "透过小窗，<br>\n我们往里面看去。",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro001": "……看来这里是惩罚室的区域呢。",
  "0201Adv15_Noah001": "惩罚室？是做什么的地方？",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative003": "诺亚也站在我旁边往里面张望。",
  "0201Adv15_Noah002": "哇，里面有好多危险的东西！",
  "0201Adv15_Noah003": "把那个那个还有那个堆叠起来做成装置艺术，<br>\n应该会很好玩～",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro002": "……是吗？",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative004": "诺亚试图打开门，<br>\n但门被一把挂锁锁住了，打不开。",
  "0201Adv15_Noah004": "气气——进不去啊？<br>\n这样就没法画画了。",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro003": "看来是这样。那我们去别的地方吧——",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative005": "我刚转身，<br>\n就看到一个少女从过道那头走了过来。",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa001": "………！",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative006": "是紫藤亚里沙。",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative007": "她也注意到了我们，<br>\n尴尬地站在原地。",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro004": "亚里沙，你应该已经被放出来了吧。<br>\n来这里是有什么事？",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa002": "没必要告诉你。",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro005": "是吗。那就不多问了。<br>\n诺亚，我们走。",
  "0201Adv15_Noah005": "亚里沙手里拿的那张纸，是什么？",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative008": "我正准备带着诺亚从亚里沙身边经过，<br>\n但诺亚似乎对亚里沙手中的纸很感兴趣。",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative009": "我也注意到了，顿时吃了一惊。",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro006": "（……报纸……？）",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative010": "看到这个与监牢格格不入的东西，<br>\n我不能坐视不理，向亚里沙走近一步。",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro007": "你这是在哪里得到的？",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa003": "……惩罚室里。<br>\n被绑在十字刑架上的时候，<br>\n偶然在架子缝隙里发现的。",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative011": "亚里沙不情愿地回答道。",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa004": "不知道是用了什么方法，<br>\n但好像是之前像我们这样被抓来的家伙搞到的。",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro008": "在这个监牢里，<br>\n外界的信息被彻底屏蔽了。<br>\n这样看来，很可能是以前的某个囚犯用了什么魔法。",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa005": "我已经看过好几遍了，给你吧。",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative012": "亚里沙把报纸递给了我。",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro009": "五年前的报道啊。真有意思……",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa006": "是啊……我想着也许还有其他线索，<br>\n所以来找找看。",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro010": "就算有什么，<br>\n所有惩罚室都上了锁，<br>\n不进去的话恐怕找不到吧。",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa007": "啧，这样哦……",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative013": "我突然注意到，<br>\n亚里沙给我的报纸边缘有微微的烧焦痕迹。",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro011": "有被烧过的痕迹啊。",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa008": "那是我干的。<br>\n报纸上有用血写的字，看着瘆得慌。",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa009": "不过后来我想可能是重要信息，<br>\n就没继续烧了。",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa010": "我的魔法是【点火】。",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative014": "亚里沙在手指尖上<br>\n轻轻燃起一小团火焰，<br>\n就好像拿着一支看不见的打火机似的。",
  "0201Adv15_Noah006": "哇～，好漂亮！！",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa011": "漂、漂亮个屁啊！",
  "0201Adv15_Noah007": "欸——超级漂亮啊？<br>\n亚里沙真厉害。",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa012": "你这家伙真让人摸不着头脑……",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro012": "（能够产生火焰的魔法吗……如果魔女化程度加深，<br>\n　这种能力可能会变得很危险）",
  "0201Adv15_Hiro013": "我们该走了。",
  "0201Adv15_Alisa013": "随你们便。<br>\n我还想再调查一下这附近。",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative015": "亚里沙似乎被惩罚室吸引住了，<br>\n她摇摇晃晃地向深处走去。",
  "0201Adv15_Narrative016": "我们离开了那里。"
}
}
